Example codes to generate station sampled files for the
2024 Barbados MAGPIE campaign.

DDF files are provided for FP, MERRA2, and an experimental
model run (c180R_arcsix).

Samples may be processed by running the sample_stations.csh
in an interactive queue (uses multiple streams). Default
sampling produces daily files. Concatenate these to a single
file using the concatenate.csh script.

Some simple plotting routines are also provided.

